Package: rctl
Type: Package
Title: Runix Command-Line Interface
Version: 0.0.1.9
Date: 2026-08-20
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: The Runix command-line interface: a machine-drivable CLI over
    the Runix subsystem packages, covering read-only introspection and
    managed service mutations. In machine mode ('--json') it emits exactly
    one versioned JSON envelope per invocation, with typed errors carrying
    condition classes and retryability; human mode is explicitly unstable.
    Subsystem packages are detected at runtime, so capability introspection
    succeeds even where they are absent.
